::MODULE{FIELDS|title:Extract only verified fields}
  title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at
::MODULE{RENDER|title:Pages and cadence}
  index provider deal compare about privacy contact | every 6 hours | English United States
::RULE{Missing price⇒omit price and price structured data}
::RULE{Expired valid_until⇒remove from active pages}
::RULE{Offer pages and pricing guides must be labeled accurately; no invented discount}
::BOUNDARY{never:invent offers invent prices invent commissions bypass robots.txt|scope:permanent}
